  "body": "Positioned at the end of the driveway for enhanced privacy and extra parking, this brand-new four-bedroom standalone home delivers modern living, excellent school zoning and a sought-after North Shore lifestyle. With its freehold title, no body corporate fees and stylish contemporary design, this is an opportunity that deserves your immediate attention.\r\n\r\n• Brand-new two-level home offering four bedrooms and modern, low-maintenance living in popular Torbay.\r\n• Prime end-of-driveway position provides greater privacy, a peaceful setting and additional off-street parking.\r\n• Freehold & standalone — no body corporate and no body corporate fees, giving you greater ownership and flexibility.\r\n• Excellent school zoning for sought-after Long Bay College, Torbay School and Northcross Intermediate, ideal for families planning ahead.\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living combines the modern lounge, kitchen and dining area, creating an inviting space for everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow leads from the living area to a private, spacious deck, perfect for summer BBQs and relaxed outdoor living.\r\n• Four-bedroom family layout, including a generous master bedroom with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, plus additional bedrooms and a stylish family bathroom upstairs.\r\n• Convenient downstairs living includes a single internal-access garage and guest toilet, providing practical separation between living and sleeping areas.\r\n• Quality modern specifications include top-notch appliances, full insulation, double glazing and contemporary finishes designed for comfort and energy efficiency.\r\n• Outstanding Torbay lifestyle with easy access to Long Bay Regional Park, Waiake Beach, local amenities and the wider North Shore.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are not unlimited. A brand-new, freehold, standalone home with four bedrooms, premium school zoning, extra parking and a private end-of-driveway position is increasingly difficult to find in Torbay. Whether you're a first-home buyer, growing family, downsizer or investor, make sure you inspect this property before someone else does. Enquire today and secure your viewing.",
